// dyn(2^192) <s const 5 -> 0. 2^192 is non-negative (bit255 clear) and has an
// upper limb set, so a > b -> false. Push const RHS (5) first, dynamic LHS on
// top. Exercises the upper-limb HasUpper select in the SLT helper.
PUSH1 0x05
PUSH32 0x0000000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x00
MLOAD
SLT
PUSH1 0x00
MSTORE
PUSH1 0x20
PUSH1 0x00
RETURN
